	Desired animal food production[AsiaPacific,PasMeat] ~~|
Indicated PasMeat Trade to Meet Demand[Regions,EastEu]=
	(1/Initial Agricultural Product Prices[Regions,PasMeat]^2)/
	(1/Initial Agricultural Product Prices[Africa,PasMeat]^2+
	 1/Initial Agricultural Product Prices[AsiaPacific,PasMeat]^2+
	 1/Initial Agricultural Product Prices[EastEu,PasMeat]^2+
