Grassland Meat Yield[Africa]=
	Reference meat yield[Africa]
	* Effect of Input Neutral Technology Change on Agricultural Land Fertility[Africa]
	* Effect of Climate Change on Agricultural Yield
	* Effect of Carbon Concentration on Agricultural Yield
	* Effect of fertilizer on yield[Africa,PasMeat]
	* Effect of Water Withdrawal on Agriculture Land Fertility ~~|
Grassland Meat Yield[AsiaPacific]=
	Reference meat yield[AsiaPacific]
	* Effect of Input Neutral Technology Change on Agricultural Land Fertility[AsiaPacific\
		]
	* Effect of Climate Change on Agricultural Yield
	* Effect of Carbon Concentration on Agricultural Yield
	* Effect of fertilizer on yield[AsiaPacific,PasMeat]
	* Effect of Water Withdrawal on Agriculture Land Fertility ~~|
Grassland Meat Yield[EastEu]=
