	* Effect of Input Neutral Technology Change on Agricultural Land Fertility[WestEu]
	* Effect of Climate Change on Agricultural Yield
	* Effect of Carbon Concentration on Agricultural Yield
	* Effect of fertilizer on yield[WestEu,PasMeat]
	* Effect of Water Withdrawal on Agriculture Land Fertility
	~	Ton/(ha*Year)
	~	Tons of meat per ha of grassland.
		The data for this variable is calculated based on the total production of \
		pasture-based animal products (bovine meat, butter, cheese, animal fat, \
		mutton and goat meat) divided by the total pasture land.
	|

