	Desired crop production[LAC,OtherCrops] ~~|
Indicated OtherCrops Trade to Meet Demand[Regions,WestEu]=
	(1/Initial Agricultural Product Prices[Regions,OtherCrops]^2)/
	(1/Initial Agricultural Product Prices[Africa,OtherCrops]^2+
	 1/Initial Agricultural Product Prices[AsiaPacific,OtherCrops]^2+
	 1/Initial Agricultural Product Prices[EastEu,OtherCrops]^2+
	 1/Initial Agricultural Product Prices[LAC,OtherCrops]^2+
	 1/Initial Agricultural Product Prices[WestEu,OtherCrops]^2)*
	Desired crop production[WestEu,OtherCrops]
	~	Ton/Year
	~	"Indicated OtherCrops Trade to Meet Demand[Region A, Region B]" represents an \
		indicated value of other crop export from Region A to Region B, serving as \
		a starting point for trade modelling. 
		It is calculated based on a logit sharing function considering other crop \
		prices in different regions to meet the other crop demand of each region.
