N leaching and runoff fraction=
	0.8 + STEP(SA N leaching and runoff fraction-0.8, 2020)
	~	1/Year
	~	Nitrate washed away. Especially going to the rivers and lakes. Runoff is \
		23% of "applied" N, not the stock as I use her. Leaching is around 12-15 M \
		ton/year. In total,  46 M ton/year. The fraction is calibrated accordingly.
