Total Crops Biomass Demand[Regions]=
	Energy Demand[Regions]*Market Share Biomass Crops[Regions]/Biomass Conversion Efficiency
	~	Biomass ton/Year
	~	Total demand for energy crops accounting for biomass energy market share \
		and reference technology development.
	|

Smoothed GDP per Capita global average=
	SMOOTH(GDP per Capita global average, Year Period)
	~	$/(Person*Year)
	~	Add the global average for modules kept at the global scale
	|

Potential Biomass Energy Production from Resources[Regions]=
	Biomass Production[Regions]*Biomass Conversion Efficiency*Biomass Capacity Factor[Regions\
		]
	~	Mtoe/Year
	~	Potential biomass energy production per year due to available resources \
		and technical developments.
	|

Total Forest Biomass Demand[Regions]=
	Energy Demand[Regions]*Market Share Biomass Forest[Regions]/Biomass Conversion Efficiency
	~	Biomass ton/Year
	~	Total demand for forest biomass accounting for forest biomass energy \
		market share and reference technology development.
	|

Effect of Management Practices on Agriculture Land Fertility=
	1+Effect of GDP on Cropland Management Practices Increment*(1-EXP(-Effect of GDP on Cropland Management Practices Elasticity
	*Smoothed GDP per Capita global average*Smoothed GDP per Capita global average))
	~	Dmnl
	~	Impact of agricultural land management practices on cropland fertility.
	|

Agricultural Water Demand[Regions]=
	(Average Agricultural Water Use per m2 Irrigated[Regions]*Irrigated Agriculture Land\
		[Regions]/Sqr m to ha)+(Average Agricultural Water Use per m2 Rainfed[Regions]*Rainfed Agriculture Land\
		[Regions]/Sqr m to ha)
	~	m*m*m/Year
	~	Total water demand for agricultural purposes. Source of Historical Data:
		International Hydrological Programme (IHP) of UNESCO, data by Shiklomanov, I.A \
		Dynamics of water use in the world (total) over the kinds of economic \
		activities
		http://webworld.unesco.org/water/ihp/db/shiklomanov/
	|

GDP per Capita global average=
	sum(Gross Domestic Product[Regions!])/sum(Population[Regions!])
	~	$/(Person*Year)
	~	Add the global average for modules kept at the global scale
	|

Elasticity of CO2 Concentration on Forest Land Fertility=
	1
	~	Dmnl
	~	Elasticity of impact of carbon concentration on forest land fertility.
	|

Climate Impact on Forest Land Fertility Nonlinearity=
	2
	~	Dmnl
	~	Elasticity of climate impact on forest land fertility.
	|

