Distortion Function C=
	IF THEN ELSE(C Concentration Ratio<=p Effect of C on Yield , 
	1+m Effect of C on Yield*(C Concentration Ratio-Calpha)/(p Effect of C on Yield-Calpha\
		), 
	1+m Effect of C on Yield - (1+m Effect of C on Yield-u Effect of C on Yield)*(C Concentration Ratio\
		-p Effect of C on Yield
	)/(Cbeta-p Effect of C on Yield))
	~	Dmnl
	~	Single Triangular Distortion Function with Static End Points
		l+m-(l+m-u)*(Iratio-p)/(1-p)
