Effect of Biodiversity on Forest Land Fertility[Regions]=
	Min Impact of Biodiversity on Forest Land Fertility+(Max Impact of Biodiversity on Forest Land Fertility\
		-Min Impact of Biodiversity on Forest Land Fertility)*(Mean Species Abundance[Regions\
		]/INIT Species Abundance[Regions])
