		[Regions])*(Smoothed GDP per Capita[Regions]/(Smoothed GDP per Capita[Regions]
	+Reference GWP per Capita for Land Irrigation[Regions]))
	~	Dmnl
	~	Nonlinear relation that determines the area of irrigated land as \
		percentage of total agricultural land as dependent on the population \
		wealth represented by GWP per capita. Scaled between minimal and maximal \
		percentage.
	|

