		Ocean as by GISS. Source: NASA Goddard Institute for Space Studies, \
		http://data.giss.nasa.gov/gistemp/graphs_v3/
	|

Temperature Anomalies HadCRUT4 v Preindustrial=
	Temperature Change from Preindustrial
	~	DegreesC
