Area=
	5.1e+14
	~	Meter*Meter
	~	Global surface area.
	|

Atmospheric and Upper Ocean Heat Capacity=
	Upper Layer Volume Vu*Volumetric Heat Capacity/Area
	~	Year*W/(Meter*Meter*DegreesC)
	~	Volumetric heat capacity for the land, atmosphere, and, upper ocean layer.
	|

Lower Layer Volume Vu 2=
	Area*(1-Land Area Fraction)*Layer Depth 2
	~	Meter*Meter*Meter
	~	Water equivalent volume of the second layer of deep ocean.
	|

Lower Layer Volume Vu 3=
	Area*(1-Land Area Fraction)*Layer Depth 3
	~	Meter*Meter*Meter
	~	Water equivalent volume of the third layer of deep ocean.
	|

Lower Layer Volume Vu 4=
	Area*(1-Land Area Fraction)*Layer Depth 4
	~	Meter*Meter*Meter
	~	Water equivalent volume of the fourth layer of deep ocean.
	|

