Heat Transfer Coefficient 2=
	((Heat Transfer Rate*Mean Depth of Adjacent 1 2 Layers)*(Heat Diffusion Covar*(Eddy diff coeff 1 2\
		/Eddy diff coeff mean 1 2)+(1-Heat Diffusion Covar)))
	~	W/(Meter*DegreesC)
	~	The ratio of the actual to the mean of the heat transfer coefficient, \
		which controls the movement of heat through the climate sector.
	|

Heat Transfer Coefficient 3=
	((Heat Transfer Rate*Mean Depth of Adjacent 2 3 Layers)*(Heat Diffusion Covar*(Eddy diff coeff 2 3\
		/Eddy diff coeff mean 2 3)+(1-Heat Diffusion Covar)))
	~	W/(Meter*DegreesC)
	~	The ratio of the actual to the mean of the heat transfer coefficient, \
		which controls the movement of heat through the climate sector.
	|

