Wind Infrastructure Adjustment[Regions]=
	Wind Capacity Aging Rate[Regions]+(Desired Wind Installed Capacity[Regions]-Wind Installed Capacity\
		[Regions])/Time to Adjust Wind Infrastructure[Regions]
	~	m*m/Year
	~	Adjustment of Wind Infrastructure to the desired level over a specified \
		adjustment time and accounting for constant infrastructure decrease due to \
		aging process.
