Full of Economic-Environment Linkages and Integration dX/dt (FeliX)
12,2,0,1128,314,564,77,8,7,0,42,-1,0,0,0,-1--1--1,-1--1--1,Arial|24||0-0-0,0,0,256,0,0,0
The Full of Economic-Environment Linkages and Integration dX/dt (FeliX) is a global system dynamics model of climate, economy, environment and society interactions, developed at International Institute for Applied Systems Analysis (IIASA), first within the GEO-BENE project.
12,3,0,1128,409,564,35,8,7,0,58,-1,0,0,0,-1--1--1,-1--1--1,Arial|26|B|0-0-0,0,0,256,0,0,0
This is the regionalized version of FeliX.
12,4,0,1128,510,564,62,8,7,0,42,-1,0,0,0,-1--1--1,-1--1--1,Arial|26|B|0-0-0,0,0,256,0,0,0
There is an online document for the global FeliX model, https://iiasa.github.io/felix_docs/. The underlying modeling methodology and information to the FeliX resources and publications are well introduced in the online document.
